    {
      "@type": "schema:DefinedTerm",
      "@id": "https://japan-cannabinoid-trends.routeflags.com/taxonomy/compound_thcb",
      "schema:name": "THCB",
      "schema:inDefinedTermSet": {
        "@type": "schema:DefinedTermSet",
        "@id": "https://japan-cannabinoid-trends.routeflags.com/taxonomy/compound-thcb-scheme"
      },
      "schema:description": "'THCB' is the owner's term, registered as a search string on 2026-11-11 by owner direction (ISS-20261111-TAX-040). Its chemical identity is UNCONFIRMED: the repository records no verified chemical name, structure, chemical class, natural occurrence, route/origin, synonym relation or regulatory status for this term, and no external identifier (CAS, ChEBI, Wikidata, PubChem) was verified - none is recorded here and none may be inferred from the query string. The term sits in compound_identity_unverified, an administrative registration-state category, so this placement asserts no route or chemical classification. What the code 'THCB' expands to is not recorded anywhere in this repository, so no chemical name is supplied. On 2026-11-11 the owner confirmed that the generic chemical interpretation of `THCB` is replaced by three distinct search-topic concepts: `Δ8-THCB`, `Δ9-THCB` and `THCB-O-acetate` (ISS-20261111-TAX-041). This concept remains the registration of the literal string `THCB`: the `thcb-general-ja` / `thcb-liquid-ja` query entries and every adopted or preserved run stay attached to this concept and are not reassigned to any new concept. The generic term is neither a synonym of nor a parent of the three concepts, and no `skos:related` or `skos:exactMatch` link is asserted; the new concepts are separate registrations. Evidence that would move the term out of this category: a documented chemical name with a verified external identifier, or a recorded source naming the substance and its route/origin; the basis belongs in docs/provenance/compound-taxonomy.md.",
      "schema:termCode": "compound_thcb"
    },
    {
      "@type": "schema:DefinedTerm",
      "@id": "https://japan-cannabinoid-trends.routeflags.com/taxonomy/compound_thcp",
      "schema:name": "THCP",
      "schema:inDefinedTermSet": {
        "@type": "schema:DefinedTermSet",
